# context/lib/rota.brix -- the rota template: eight themes in order, and one active index base.
# Add or reorder a theme here and nowhere else. The index base is one-indexed for the live rota.
# The count, row rule and row shape come from context/lib/rota-base.brix, the shared base the fifteen-round rota also composes from.
format rota-brix-v1
rota themes 8
index base one
row 1 leo-fire
row 2 cancer-fire
row 3 leo-water
row 4 cancer-water
row 5 leo-air
row 6 cancer-air
row 7 leo-earth
row 8 cancer-earth
row-of-count rule ((count - 1) mod 8) + 1
